## 111. Edition-2027 Grammar And Execution Semantics


The grammar integrates advanced declarations with the retained four-space lexical layout.

Primary declaration introducers include:

```text
capsule
family
chain
extension
```

Contextual modifiers include:

```text
isolate
inherit
contract
allow
deny
limit
zone
qualifier
```

Structured state operations include:

```text
checkpoint
rollback
revert
recover
postpone
```

Typed data operations retain ordinary method or intrinsic representation where appropriate.

### 18.1 Integrated example

```pcn
module secure.inventory

family InventoryFamily
    member InventoryBase
    member SecureInventory

    contract shared nonnegative_stock

capsule InventoryBase
    isolate logical

    private var stock: int = 0

    contract invariant stock >= 0

    public routine quantity(self) gives int
        give self.stock

capsule SecureInventory inherit InventoryBase
    isolate deep

    private var items: smart_array<int, 16>

    zone inventory_state
        deny external_mutation
        deny raw_export
        allow verified_updates

    limit memory = 1_048_576

    public routine update(
        var self,
        index: size,
        value: int
    ) gives result<void, InventoryError>

        if value < 0
            fail InventoryError.invalid_quantity

        if index >= 16
            fail InventoryError.out_of_bounds

        checkpoint @update
            self.items[index] = value

        give

chain InventoryReview(inventory: InventoryHandle)
    gives InventoryReport
    stage identified = identify(inventory)
    stage ready = availability(inventory)

    stage report after identified, ready
        if ready
            give InventoryReport.available(inventory.quantity())

        give InventoryReport.unavailable
```

The complete program supplies the referenced error types, declarations, identities and protocol endpoints.

Protected Capsule access uses authorized mediation rather than unverified direct memory access.

