# 17. WHAT PURPOSES AND EDGE CASES DOES PARACINE ADDRESS?

Paracine's detailed semantics cover ordinary execution as well as difficult boundary conditions.

### Numerical edge cases

Signed integer overflow follows defined modular arithmetic.

Division by zero has an explicit terminal or checked failure model.

Decimal and floating-point calculations preserve their selected rounding and exceptional-value contracts.

Posit arithmetic distinguishes NaR from IEEE NaN.

Matrix inversion handles noninvertible inputs through defined domain behavior.

### Memory edge cases

References cannot legally outlive their owning storage.

Mutable aliases require exclusivity or proven disjointness.

Resizing respects live borrow relationships and initialization requirements.

Arena reset follows region lifetime constraints.

Meta-Pointers preserve the distinction between address metadata and valid provenance.

### Structural edge cases

Graph traversal defines cycle handling, node identity, traversal order and work bounds.

Removing nodes requires explicit structural integrity policies.

Families preserve their contract relationships.

Chains reject invalid dependencies and cycles.

### Transaction edge cases

Nested checkpoints maintain reversible mutation histories.

Snapshots capture immutable state representations.

Rollback restores only eligible state.

External effects are governed by their own transaction contracts.

Terminal traps do not invoke automatic rollback.

### Concurrency edge cases

Structured child tasks obey scope lifetime requirements.

Atomics follow the formal memory model.

Smart Mutex coordinates protected mutable state.

Channels define ordering, ownership and disconnection behavior.

### Security edge cases

Invalid authority is rejected.

Stale handles are validated by generation.

Unsupported deep isolation fails closed.

Foreign handles require explicit transfer rules.

Native system calls follow target-specific contracts.

Hot-swapped implementations preserve required state, ABI and authority relationships.

Paracine addresses these cases by specifying their actual semantics rather than relying on accidental machine behavior.

